{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18804","headline":"乐天寄洛下新诗兼喜微之欲到因以抒怀也 · 刘禹锡","name":"乐天寄洛下新诗兼喜微之欲到因以抒怀也","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松间风未起，万叶不自吟。\n池上月未来，清辉同夕阴。\n宫徵不独运，埙篪自相寻。\n一从别乐天，诗思日已沈。\n吟君洛中作，精绝百链金。\n乃知孤鹤情，月露爲知音。\n微之从东来，威凤鸣归林。\n羡君先相见，一豁平生心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18804.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18804","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}